OL,6,     FIn 1999, Canada's map was redrawn
OL,7,     Fto create Nunavut, a territory
OL,8,     Freflecting Inuit land rights. It
OL,9,     Ffollowed more than 20 years of
OL,10,     Fcampaigning.
